data: {"answer": "這裡是餐廳收銀區，可以看到收銀機、刷卡機和收據印表機。\n重點在於收據只顯示卡號末四碼，且絕對不能把密碼貼在便利貼上。\n這個區域屬於持卡人資料環境（PCI 範圍），要注意刷卡機側錄與竄改的威脅。\n防護措施包含桌面淨空、螢幕淨空、刷卡機定期檢查以及點對點加密。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "刷卡機是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Card Payment Terminal do?", "zh": "刷卡機是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "刷卡機側錄與竄改要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent card skimming & terminal tampering?", "zh": "刷卡機側錄與竄改要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 9.03, "total_s": 9.04}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "hall_near", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "hall_near"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.2}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "hall_near", "label": "Room", "en": "Restaurant · Up Close", "zh": "餐廳近看"}, {"key": "pin_pad", "label": "System", "en": "Card Payment Terminal", "zh": "刷卡機"}, {"key": "pos", "label": "System", "en": "Point of Sale (POS)", "zh": "餐飲收銀系統（POS）"}, {"key": "skimming", "label": "Threat", "en": "Card Skimming & Terminal Tampering", "zh": "刷卡機側錄與竄改"}, {"key": "clear_desk", "label": "Control", "en": "Clear Desk & Clear Screen", "zh": "桌面淨空與螢幕淨空"}, {"key": "terminal_inspection", "label": "Control", "en": "Payment Terminal Inspection", "zh": "刷卡機定期檢查"}, {"key": "p2pe_tokenization", "label": "Control", "en": "P2PE & Tokenization", "zh": "點對點加密與代碼化"}, {"key": "pan_masking", "label": "Control", "en": "Card Number Masking", "zh": "卡號遮罩"}, {"key": "c_pci_scope", "label": "Concept", "en": "Cardholder Data Environment (PCI scope)", "zh": "持卡人資料環境（PCI 範圍）"}], "edges": [{"a": "pos", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "pin_pad", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "skimming", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "pin_pad"}, {"a": "skimming", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "c_pci_scope", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "c_pci_scope", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "p2pe_tokenization"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "pin_pad"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "pos"}, {"a": "pan_masking", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "terminal_inspection", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_near"}, {"a": "terminal_inspection", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "pin_pad"}, {"a": "terminal_inspection", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "skimming"}, {"a": "clear_desk", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_near"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：餐廳近看・收銀機\n這裡講的是：近看收銀機、刷卡機和收據印表機。\n重點：收據只印卡號末四碼；密碼不能貼在便利貼上。\n這裡的系統：刷卡機、餐飲收銀系統（POS）\n這裡要注意的威脅：刷卡機側錄與竄改\n看得到的防護措施：桌面淨空與螢幕淨空、刷卡機定期檢查、點對點加密與代碼化、卡號遮罩\n課程概念：持卡人資料環境（PCI 範圍）\n相關的處理流程：每日刷卡機檢查、刷卡機疑似被動過\n這個房間藏著 2 個漏洞（讓玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：餐廳收銀系統", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 9.03, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 695, "prompt_s": 2.36, "gen_tokens": 92, "gen_s": 6.65, "tok_per_s": 13.8, "first_token_s": 2.38}}, "state": {}}

